cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ligase in research, please cite it as below."
title: "Ligase: dimension checking for computational biology pipelines"
abstract: >-
  Ligase gives biological datasets the dimensions of what is inside them --
  which organism, which reference build, which coordinate convention, which
  samples in which order -- and refuses to connect two steps whose dimensions
  disagree, at graph-build time, before any computation runs.
type: software
